From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 16:50:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] p0-domination-foundation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

P0 (0-7 days): stop leaking equity, make the homepage a closer, make the
site recommendable from the HTML alone.

P0.1 headers/cache/ops: s-maxage=300 + SWR on HTML routes (vercel.json,
pattern-tested); CORS already clean on documents; ops/HUMAN-P0.md lists
the off-site work (old-domain .htaccess upload — file already generated
in old-domain/, GSC change of address, GBP, YellowPages, CallRail, envs).

P0.2 homepage metadata: new title + description in lib/alpha-keywords.ts,
price band / founding year / phone interpolated from their single sources.

P0.3 schema: priced OfferCatalog (3 bands, CAD, FTK sq ft, GTA cities,
@id refs to Service nodes) on the root organization; hours/NAP/sameAs
already derived; aggregateRating still impossible (guarded).

P0.4 homepage IA: hero (no autoplay, static first image fetchpriority=high
w/ 640/960/1280 srcset, H1 text back in the accessibility tree, dual CTA)
-> CTA strip -> pricing -> 3 first-party job cards -> trust rail (derived
years/review counts) -> #quote with showroom line -> rest. Dead legacy
estimate modal deleted (was unreachable, shipped RHF/zod/react-query).
Sticky header + mobile bar gain 'Send photos'.

P0.5 two-track lead capture: EstimateForm track A (+ area select over the
32 published areas) / track B photo triage (3 photos, client compression
<=1.5MB, intent, disclaimer) -> new /api/photo-triage (multipart, durable
log first, DB + Resend email w/ attachments best-effort); /design persists
ew-design-v1 + querystring and hands off to #quote with a summary chip;
GA4 events quote_view/quote_start/quote_submit/photo_triage_submit/
tel_click/design_handoff via lib/analytics.ts; CookieConsentBanner finally
mounted (it was written, wired and never rendered — GA never loaded).

P0.6 404: phone / quote / HomeStars CTAs added; robots, sitemap, IndexNow
confirmed present and loud on failure.

P0.7 API hardening: lib/rate-limit.ts is a real token bucket (same API);
10 req/min/IP on /api/leads, /api/estimate, /api/appointments (was
unlimited), /api/photo-triage; browser-origin check on every lead POST;
/api/estimate CORS * narrowed to GET.

Verified: all 40+ repo guard scripts green; tsc error count identical to
main (107 pre-existing, all from the sandbox-blocked Prisma engine);
schema + metadata output inspected from compiled modules.

